<title>FINLAND: HELIBOR INTEREST RATES STEADY TO LOWER.</title>
<headline>HELIBOR INTEREST RATES STEADY TO LOWER.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helibor rates were steady or</p>
<p>lower at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Thursday. The</p>
<p>three-month Helibor rate was steady at 3.09 percent.</p>
<p>					  January 9 fix	  Jan 8 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor			   3.01 pct		3.01 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor			   3.05 pct		3.05 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor			   3.09 pct		3.09 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor			   3.19 pct		3.20 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor			   3.29 pct		3.30 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor			  3.38 pct		3.39 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 245</p>
</text>
